      "nets": ["NET0059"],
      "observed": "On the Motion Sensing / CAN BUS tile, U31 pin 2 is labeled NET0059. On the CM4 tile, the same global label NET0059 is attached to Module1 pin 128, which is CAM0_D0_N. This connects the input of the ESTOP_OUT buffer to the CM4 camera data line.",
      "expected": "The e-stop path should be driven by the e-stop sink/ESTOP_OUT circuitry (or a fixed logic level for an open-drain sink), not by an unrelated camera interface signal. The specification describes an e-stop loop with sink buffers feeding ESTOP_OUT, not a camera-data-driven e-stop output.",
