        {"source": "schematic", "quote": "U31 pin 2 label: NET0059 (Motion Sensing / CAN BUS tile)"},
        {"source": "schematic", "quote": "Module1 pin 128: CAM0_D0_N, net label NET0059 (CM4 tile)"},
        {"source": "spec", "quote": "an e-stop loop with multiple sink points ... gated through single non-inverting buffers ... feeding an ESTOP_OUT signal shared with the CAN connectors J2/J13"}
      ],
      "impact": "The e-stop output would be controlled by, or loaded by, the CM4 camera data line instead of the intended e-stop loop. This can prevent reliable e-stop assertion and corrupt camera data if the camera interface is used.",
      "confidence": 0.55
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The drawing shows a likely anomaly: the ESTOP_OUT buffer U31 input is tied to the CM4 camera data net NET0059 (CAM0_D0_N), merging an unrelated camera signal into the e-stop path instead of using the specified e-stop sink circuitry."
}

